  backgroundNameEn: "Traveling Merchant"
  descriptionEn: "You've traveled far and wide for years, always carrying odd and curious goods. You've heard that Xuri Village is rich in rare stones and strange herbs, so you've decided to do a little trading on the side during this mapping job.\n\nYou get two extra random consumables."
